<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>東山文薈 Dongshan Literary</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:
    "Noto Serif TC",
    "Songti TC",
    serif;

    background:#f5f1ea;
    color:#222;
    line-height:1.8;
}

a{
    text-decoration:none;
    color:inherit;
}

header{

    position:fixed;
    width:100%;
    top:0;

    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    background:rgba(245,241,234,.88);

    border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;

    z-index:100;
}

nav{

    width:90%;
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;

    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;

    padding:18px 0;
}

.logo{

    font-size:30px;
    letter-spacing:8px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.menu{

    display:flex;
    gap:40px;
}

.menu a{

    transition:.3s;
}

.menu a:hover{

    color:#8c2f39;
}

.hero{

    margin-top:72px;

    height:92vh;

    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;

    background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.45),rgba(0,0,0,.45)),
    url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512820790803-83ca734da794?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80");

    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center;

    color:white;
    text-align:center;
}

.hero h1{

    font-size:88px;
    letter-spacing:12px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{

    font-size:22px;
    opacity:.9;
    margin-bottom:45px;
}

.button{

    display:inline-block;

    padding:14px 34px;

    border:1px solid white;

    transition:.3s;
}

.button:hover{

    background:white;
    color:#222;
}

section{

    width:90%;
    max-width:1200px;

    margin:100px auto;
}

.title{

    font-size:42px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.subtitle{

    color:#777;
    margin-bottom:50px;
}

.grid{

    display:grid;

    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));

    gap:35px;
}

.card{

    background:white;

    padding:35px;

    border-radius:8px;

    transition:.3s;

    box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}

.card:hover{

    transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.category{

    color:#8c2f39;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    font-size:14px;
}

.card h3{

    font-size:24px;
    margin-bottom:16px;
}

.issue{

    background:#ece6db;

    padding:80px 0;

    text-align:center;
}

.issue h2{

    font-size:60px;
    letter-spacing:8px;
}

.issue p{

    margin:20px auto;

    width:700px;
    max-width:90%;
}

footer{

    background:#1d1d1d;

    color:#ccc;

    padding:60px;

    text-align:center;
}

footer h2{

    color:white;

    margin-bottom:15px;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

.hero h1{

font-size:50px;

letter-spacing:4px;

}

.logo{

font-size:24px;

}

.menu{

display:none;

}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

<nav>

<div class="logo">
東山文薈
</div>

<div class="menu">

<a href="#">首頁</a>

<a href="#">最新刊物</a>

<a href="#">作品典藏</a>

<a href="#">文編招新</a>

<a href="#">關於我們</a>

</div>

</nav>

</header>

<section class="hero">

<div>

<h1>東山文薈</h1>

<p>
文字，是我們觀看世界的方法。
</p>

<a class="button" href="#">
閱讀最新一期
</a>

</div>

</section>

<section>

<h2 class="title">
最新作品
</h2>

<p class="subtitle">
Latest Articles
</p>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">

<div class="category">
小說
</div>

<h3>
迷惘於尚未到來
</h3>

<p>
青春總是在尚未抵達之前，就開始懷念。
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="category">
散文
</div>

<h3>
索居
</h3>

<p>
關於旅行、語言與家的反思。
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="category">
詩
</div>

<h3>
芥子見須彌
</h3>

<p>
所有宏大的宇宙，都藏在微不足道的細節裡。
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="issue">

<h2>
第十四期
</h2>

<p>

